  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udd25 VoiceAssistant-Eval: Benchmarking AI Assistants across Listening, Speaking, and Viewing\n\t\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[\ud83c\udf10 Homepage] \n[\ud83d\udd2e Visualization]\n[\ud83d\udcbb Github] \n[\ud83d\udcd6 Paper]\n[\ud83d\udcca Leaderboard ] \n[\ud83d\udcca Detailed Leaderboard ] \n[\ud83d\udcca Roleplay Leaderboard ] \n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83d\ude80 Data Usage\n\t\n\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\nfor split in ['listening_general', 'listening_music', 'listening_sound', 'listening_speech', \n'speaking_assistant', 'speaking_emotion', 'speaking_instruction_following'\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/MathLLMs/VoiceAssistant-Eval.",
